B.PW=s(["Namaste {n} ji \ud83d\ude4f {a} ka payment abhi pending hai. Kripya aaj bhej dijiye, dhanyavaad.","{n} ji, aapko yaad dilana chahte hain ki {a} baaki hai. Suvidha anusaar jaldi bhej dijiyega \ud83d\ude4f","Hello {n}, {a} ka hisaab abhi tak clear nahi hua. Aaj kar dijiye toh badi meherbani hogi."],t.s)
